{"id":"migom","lemma":"мигом","pos":"adv","rank":4619,"glosses":["in a trice, in a flash"],"examples":[{"text":"Я мигом.","en":"I'll be quick.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/151883","words":[{"g":"I"},null]},{"text":"Мы тебя мигом домой доставим.","en":"We'll get you home in a jiffy.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"you","l":"ты"},null,{"g":"home"},{"g":"to deliver","l":"доставить"}]},{"text":"Ты мигом почувствуешь себя лучше.","en":"You'll feel better in no time.","words":[{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"to feel","l":"почувствовать"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"rather, would better )"}]},{"text":"Вы все мигом привыкнете к холодному климату.","en":"You'll all get used to the cold climate in no time.","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"everyone, everybody"},null,{"g":"to get used","l":"привыкнуть"},{"g":"to"},null,null]}]}